From 7532c83f9cc07a8503f76eaf5269eeb19eeb6a85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 09:43:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Smart Campaigns: image fit controls, app-category product
 picker, per-store targeting
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add cover/contain/fill fit control for homepage + category artwork, applied
  in the admin preview and on the customer hero + category banners.
- Replace the 'When tapped → Specific product' picker (which listed every raw
  Square catalogue item) with the banner-builder picker: app categories →
  product-builder products, so a tap loads the key product ready to add to cart.
  Shared by the hero and category placements.
- Add per-store targeting to each campaign ('All stores' or tick specific
  stores; unticked stores excluded), matching the banner builder. Filtered
  client-side for hero slides and per-category banners.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0187Jj4Q77V4UPawzEh9gsGr
